// density for a useful map/scorecard demo, each real record is expanded into several
// nearby points (small randomized offset around the real coordinate, randomized
// open/closed status and age) — so locations, categories, and neighborhoods are real,
// but the exact multiplicity/status of every single point is synthesized for demo bulk.
